Error: No module named 'future'\r\n\r\nIt's not finding the `future` module of python. Did you try installing it?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1597014639/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1926288586", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089#issuecomment-1926288586", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089", "id": 1926288586, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5y0NTK", "user": {"login": "SinPingWu", "id": 12540788, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTQwNzg4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12540788?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu", "html_url": "https://github.com/SinPingWu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-02-05T06:04:05Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-05T06:04:05Z", "body": "I also have the same problem and the future module is installed, how can I solve this problem.\r\n![image](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/assets/12540788/4d7504af-c976-4f9f-a3d6-9bb1c59cf470)\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1926288586/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1926725807", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089#issuecomment-1926725807", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089", "id": 1926725807, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5y14Cv", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-02-05T11:03:28Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-05T11:03:28Z", "body": "I have seen situations where there are multiple versions of Python installed, and it detects one where the module is not installed.\r\n\r\nCan you tried to run the build from a Python venv? Something like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 -m venv venv # create the venv\r\nsource ./venv/bin/activate # get into the venv\r\npip install future # install future in the venv\r\ncmake [...] # run your MAVSDK build in the venv, with the cmake command you usually use\r\n```", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1926725807/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1928778079", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089#issuecomment-1928778079", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089", "id": 1928778079, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5y9tFf", "user": {"login": "SinPingWu", "id": 12540788, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTQwNzg4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12540788?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu", "html_url": "https://github.com/SinPingWu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SinPingWu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-02-06T04:47:04Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-06T04:47:50Z", "body": "I solved the problem by rebuilding the dockcross/android-arm64 image.\r\n`\r\nFROM dockcross/android-arm64:latest\r\n\r\nENV DEFAULT_DOCKCROSS_IMAGE mydockcross/android-arm64\r\nRUN apt-get install python3-future\r\n`", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1928778079/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1929279542", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089#issuecomment-1929279542", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2089", "id": 1929279542, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5y_ng2", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-02-06T11:03:18Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-06T11:03:18Z", "body": "Oh you are using dockcross. The original issue was on Windows.\r\n\r\nI am a bit surprise that it doesn't work for you on dockcross, b